{{!--
  Signing in to the web app itself with the wallet.

  The same mechanism the relying parties use, with this application as the
  relying party. Nothing on the page names the person: the wallet answers with
  its own Wallet ID, and the account is whichever one is registered with that
  wallet's email. No account, no sign-in — nothing is ever provisioned here.
--}}
<section class="page-hero page-hero--compact">
  <p class="eyebrow">{{site.branding.shortName}}</p>
  <h1>Approve this sign-in from your wallet.</h1>
  <p>
    Scan the code with the Aegis wallet on your phone, or open the link on the
    phone the wallet is installed on, and approve with your biometric.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="band band--white">
  <div class="auth-grid auth-grid--compact">
    <div class="auth-panel">
      <div class="auth-panel__form"
           data-wallet-signin="{{challengeId}}"
           data-wallet-signin-complete="/auth/login/wallet/complete">
        <h2>Scan with the Aegis ID wallet</h2>

        <div class="wallet-signin__qr">
          <img src="{{qrCodeDataUrl}}" alt="QR code containing this sign-in request" width="240" height="240">
        </div>

        <p class="form-footnote wallet-signin__link">{{deepLink}}</p>

        <p>
          <a class="button button--primary" href="{{deepLink}}">Open in my wallet</a>
        </p>

        <p class="form-footnote" data-wallet-signin-status role="status" aria-live="polite">
          Waiting for your wallet. This request expires in about {{expiresInMinutes}} minutes.
        </p>

        <p class="form-footnote"><a href="/auth/login">Sign in another way</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">No password, no code</p>
      <h2>Your phone is the second factor.</h2>
      <p>
        Approving needs the wallet on your phone and your face, fingerprint or
        passcode — possession and a biometric — so nothing else is asked of you
        here.
      </p>
      <p>
        The account that opens is the one registered with your wallet's email
        address. If there is none, you will be told; no account is created.
      </p>
      <p class="form-footnote">
        No wallet yet? <a href="/support">Support</a> explains how to set one up.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
